                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bad9a73b-1f03-4fe5-b9d1-ec9e563e9893",
                        "source_entry_id": "03cc5104-8c09-30dc-b023-85e989f280cd",
                        "source_sense_description": "Иноязычные аналоги",
                        "target_lang_word": "Natalie",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Natalie",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b4879a1-5407-3723-8ca4-292e67ae0a9e",
                                        "entry_id": "77e4ebc9-f9ac-36d0-99cb-da74a3d63f12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female given name from Latin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be8fced1-cab6-4134-991e-f070512e0dd2",
                                                "sense_id": "6b4879a1-5407-3723-8ca4-292e67ae0a9e",
                                                "text": "[…] often I have listened to my dear brother, as he told me the pretty story of the sad gentleman whom he met, when I was but an infant, and how he spoke to me so tenderly, and sighed for his own Natalie. I had no other name then but Sea-flower, and I have been called by that name ever since; yet after that day, my Christian name was Natalie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "904d7fb4-6db2-47ef-b6a5-729cb83a359b",
                                                "sense_id": "6b4879a1-5407-3723-8ca4-292e67ae0a9e",
                                                "text": "I was ashamed of my very name, Natalie. Nobody else in town had the name Natalie. I wanted to have a name like Frances or Elizabeth, as two of the most popular little girls were named. When old ladies at church would say to me kindly enough,\"What's your name, little girl?\" I would answer \"Natalie,\" and they would say, \"Madaline, Mattie, what did you say?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03af9c20-ae94-41e1-b29b-a1c85490b48d",
                                                "sense_id": "6b4879a1-5407-3723-8ca4-292e67ae0a9e",
                                                "text": "ELSTON. Natalie is a beautiful name.\nNATALIE. Well, yes. It is. Thank you.\nELSTON. A real spy name. My wife Natasha has a spy name and I'm forever telling her […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "72240486-fbad-4e0b-a463-f1d2a2cd5a02",
                        "source_entry_id": "03cc5104-8c09-30dc-b023-85e989f280cd",
                        "source_sense_description": "Иноязычные аналоги",
                        "target_lang_word": "Nathalie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nathalie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09288efa-5593-3f13-a17b-0709b1c9a0a2",
                                        "entry_id": "36553f0d-72cb-3a75-bb48-0e3c5b932ee2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prénom féminin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f76e8529-e44e-4a9a-bb53-5e034f619dc0",
                                                "sense_id": "09288efa-5593-3f13-a17b-0709b1c9a0a2",
                                                "text": "Il se convainquit que si Nathalie n’était pas pourvue des attraits de Madame Pavin, elle en avait que des yeux avisés savaient peser et priser, plus clairvoyants que les siens qu’il urgeait de décataracter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e7102c3-eef9-49c3-83a6-6a32fc6db627",
                                                "sense_id": "09288efa-5593-3f13-a17b-0709b1c9a0a2",
                                                "text": "Les tenants de la Terre plate s’affirment ! En 2019, une conseillère municipale de Gatineau, Nathalie Lemieux, dans un message, a écrit : « Qui a décidé que la Terre est ronde et pourquoi le croire lui ? »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46999fb8-9080-44e8-bc35-c56342bd6ef4",
                                                "sense_id": "09288efa-5593-3f13-a17b-0709b1c9a0a2",
                                                "text": "La place Rouge était vide\n Je lui pris son bras, elle a souri\n Il avait des cheveux blonds, mon guide\n Nathalie, Nathalie…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
